<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/43/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "All acts under the Act, approvals, directions, notices, guidelines, circulars, guidance notes, practice notes, rulings, decisions, notifications, exemptions and other executive acts, howsoever called, done, given or made by the Kuala Lumpur Regional Centre for Arbitration before the coming into operation of this Act shall continue to remain in full force and effect, until amended, replaced, rescinded or revoked."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/43/eng@> .
